User auditing
Only needed service accounts and authorized users should be on a system
Accounts should only be in groups they are authorized to be in. Ex: an intern should not be in the admin group
User’s passwords should expire
Guest and admin account should be disabled
Local users and groups (lusrmgr.msc)
Allows for account management with detailed information about users and groups
On a domain-controller, an admin would become the domain on all computers
When signing in .\Administrator anything before the backlash is what you are authenticating against
